      "tqx.s5.expl.relevant": 'The test name "testSomething" gives no indication of what is being verified.',
      "tqx.s5.expl.style": "Both the name and the assertion signal this test was generated with no real intent.",
      "tqx.s5.rejected": "Fails relevance and hardening \u2014 the test adds no confidence in the system's correctness.",
      "tqx.s6.title": "Test 6 \u2014 Boundary age check",
      "tqx.s6.accepted": "Tests boundary values (17, 18, 65) with clear assertions and proper naming.",
      "tqx.acc.title": "Engineer Acceptance Rates (ACH Paper)",
