            "type": "multichoice",
            "name": "Off point of a compound predicate",
            "text": "<p>Consider the compound predicate <code>(x &gt;= 10) &amp;&amp; (x &lt;= 20)</code>. Which single value is an <strong>off point</strong> of this predicate?</p>",
