            "generalFeedback": "Concatenation puts untrusted data and SQL code into one string. Because the parser sees a single text, it cannot distinguish the intended value from characters meant to act as SQL. Separating the channels \u2014 as parameterisation does \u2014 resolves the confusion.",
            "single": true
