            "generalFeedback": 'HICCUPPS is a heuristic list of oracles \u2014 ways to recognise a problem by an inconsistency: with History, Image, Comparable products, Claims, User expectations, the Product itself, its Purpose, and Standards. It answers "how would I know this is a bug?"',
            "single": true
