            "generalFeedback": "Scripted testing is preferable when precise, repeatable, documented steps matter \u2014 regulatory evidence, contractual acceptance, and stable regression checks that must run the same way every time. Exploratory and scripted testing are complementary; the choice depends on the goal.",
