              {
                "text": "It removes the need for a test oracle entirely",
                "fraction": 0,
                "feedback": "The orbit equalities act as metamorphic relations \u2014 partial oracles \u2014 but do not eliminate oracles altogether."
              },
              {
                "text": "It increases the number of required tests to be safe",
                "fraction": 0,
                "feedback": "The whole point is a reduction: fewer representatives, derived CACC pairs, and reusable metamorphic relations."
              }
