            "generalFeedback": "Because x % 20 cycles, the distance to r == 7 forms repeating valleys every 20 units, so a local search can settle into the wrong basin. Only the basins at x = 67 and x = 87 also satisfy the inner x > 50, which is what makes the full target elusive.",
